{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27333","headline":"送人至岭南 · 袁不约","name":"送人至岭南","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"度岭春风暖，花多不识名。\n瘴烟迷月色，巴路傍溪声。\n畏药将银试，防蛟避水行。\n知君怜酒兴，莫杀醉猩猩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"袁不约","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27333.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27333","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}